  "query_preview": "Outlook... Scattered showers and thunderstorms \nbringing brief MVFR/IFR conditions are expected to continue \ninto Saturday evening. Some showers are possible on Sunday, but \ncoverage should be less than previous days. There is also a low \npotential for late night/early morning stratus or ground fog \naffecting KLBT and KFLO late Saturday night and again late \nSunday night. VFR conditions should prevail Monday through \nWednesday as a more stable and drier Canadian airmass builds in \nfrom the northeast.",
